                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 826/122.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Chargé Janes.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-01-20"><hi rendition="#italic">January 20,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Root instructs Mr. Janes to express the appreciation of the United States for
                    the continuance of tariff reduction.</p>
            </div>
